# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. The code before the per-entry binding: Push
# binds the batch's declared origin to the caller but not the origin each entry
# names, so an entry claiming a third cluster advances or suppresses that
# cluster's stream under the caller's credential.
MODULE: ReceiverPushEntryOriginUnbound
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a pushed entry may name an origin other than the batch's

--- FIND
         ELSE IF m = "Push" /\ entry # body THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- REPLACE
         ELSE IF FALSE THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- END